  "abstract": "Test a lighter synthesis: static Mixture-of-Timescales head (R=2, \u03b1=0.04) plus Huber(\u03b4=0.01) with curvature regularization on the H=128 ScalarRamp baseline. Evaluates whether smaller MoT capacity pairs better with robust loss.",
